{"id":"ea730faf0a9f37d4","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-complete-and-sound.md","title":"Complete and Sound System","display":"prop-complete-and-sound — Complete and Sound System","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-complete-and-sound","aliases":["92-prop-complete-and-sound"],"display":"prop-complete-and-sound — Complete and Sound System","depends_on":["[[92-df-complete-system]]","[[92-df-sound-system]]","[[92-df-true-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-theorem]]"],"source":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义","source_status":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-complete-and-sound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-complete-and-sound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-complete-and-sound — Complete and Sound System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c04baacf4202d9f7\" href=\"?note=c04baacf4202d9f7\" title=\"92-df-complete-system\">92-df-complete-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d76d3a84b374975c\" href=\"?note=d76d3a84b374975c\" title=\"92-df-sound-system\">92-df-sound-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d782096c679079e3\" href=\"?note=d782096c679079e3\" title=\"92-df-true-arithmetic\">92-df-true-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60c7ba64b8865701\" href=\"?note=60c7ba64b8865701\" title=\"92-df-theorem\">92-df-theorem</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Complete},\\mathrm{Sound}\">\\(\\mathrm{Complete},\\mathrm{Sound}\\)</span> (completeness and soundness predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Thm}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Thm}_G\\)</span> (theorem set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"60c7ba64b8865701\" href=\"?note=60c7ba64b8865701\" title=\"92-df-theorem\">92-df-theorem</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{TA}_G\\)</span> (true arithmetic, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d782096c679079e3\" href=\"?note=d782096c679079e3\" title=\"92-df-true-arithmetic\">92-df-true-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}complete\\text{-}and\\text{-}sound}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Thm}_G=\\mathrm{TA}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}complete\\text{-}and\\text{-}sound}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Thm}_G=\\mathrm{TA}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>完备且算术可靠，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Thm}_G=\\mathrm{TA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Thm}_G=\\mathrm{TA}_G\\)</span></li>\n<li>可靠性给出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Thm}_G\\subseteq\\mathrm{TA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Thm}_G\\subseteq\\mathrm{TA}_G\\)</span></li>\n<li>完备：对每个句子，证明它或否定</li>\n<li>若完备且可靠，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span>包含所有真句子（完备）</li>\n<li>且不含假句子（可靠）</li>\n<li>因此<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G) = \\mathrm{TA}\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G) = \\mathrm{TA}\\)</span></li>\n<li>对递归可公理化且足够强的相容算术系统，不完备性定理排除这种组合</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-complete-system","status":"resolved","id":"c04baacf4202d9f7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-complete-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sound-system","status":"resolved","id":"d76d3a84b374975c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sound-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-true-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"d782096c679079e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-true-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"60c7ba64b8865701","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"60c7ba64b8865701","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Thm}_G$ (theorem set, see [[92-df-theorem]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-true-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"d782096c679079e3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TA}_G$ (true arithmetic, see [[92-df-true-arithmetic]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Complete},\\mathrm{Sound}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Thm}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TA}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}complete\\text{-}and\\text{-}sound}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Thm}_G=\\mathrm{TA}_G","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Thm}_G=\\mathrm{TA}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Thm}_G\\subseteq\\mathrm{TA}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(G) = \\mathrm{TA}","display":false}],"bytes":1474,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-331","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-prop-complete-and-sound]]"}],"outgoing":["c04baacf4202d9f7","d76d3a84b374975c","d782096c679079e3","60c7ba64b8865701"]}